  "description": "My First Love Came from the Future.\n\nSu-A is about to marry Ha-Min, a kind and affectionate man. But then Yi-Gyeom, the man she had pined for in a heart-wrenching, one-sided love for 19 years, suddenly reappears in her life. Six years ago, Yi-Gyeom had suddenly left for a foreign country without a word. Now, after rejecting her confessions for 19 years, he proposes to Su-A just three months before her wedding...\n\nThen comes a warning: “If you marry that man, you’ll die.”\n\nStunned by this absurd turn of events, Su-A tries to distance herself from Yi-Gyeom, but before she knows it, he begins to intrude on her daily life.\n\nWhy on earth is he doing this now? Once upon a time, there was a man I loved deeply but who hated me just as much: Yi-Gyeom. Now, there’s a man who has promised to marry me and loves only me: Ha-Min. And there’s a woman who is the object of both men’s love: Su-Ah. \n\nThe tragic fate of these three people, entangled in 49 reincarnations.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
